{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls6_jpg\\comp\\079.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "awaz e inqilab.com", "conf": 0.898, "box": [[419, 16], [858, 14], [859, 57], [419, 59]]}, {"text": "5.1EthicsandSafetyinICT", "conf": 0.879, "box": [[319, 86], [871, 82], [871, 124], [319, 129]]}, {"text": "It is the duty of every citizen of a country to respect all the members of the society, be", "conf": 0.947, "box": [[38, 152], [1158, 147], [1159, 180], [38, 185]]}, {"text": "responsible and abide by the laws. A good digital citizen is one who has the knowledge", "conf": 0.898, "box": [[36, 194], [1159, 192], [1160, 228], [36, 230]]}, {"text": "and skills to properlyusethe Informationand Communication Technology(ICT).", "conf": 0.898, "box": [[38, 240], [1081, 240], [1081, 273], [38, 273]]}, {"text": "ICT provides us different ways of working, thinking, and playing. This makes life of the", "conf": 0.932, "box": [[37, 296], [1160, 295], [1161, 327], [37, 329]]}, {"text": "people easier in a good way. However, not only in a good way, this aspect can also be", "conf": 0.949, "box": [[37, 340], [1160, 336], [1161, 372], [37, 376]]}, {"text": "easily manipulated by the criminals to gain benefits.Generally,computer ethics is", "conf": 0.902, "box": [[41, 387], [1159, 387], [1159, 417], [41, 417]]}, {"text": "neededto avoidtheimproperusageofcomputertechnology.", "conf": 0.928, "box": [[39, 430], [821, 433], [821, 463], [39, 460]]}, {"text": "Ensuring the", "conf": 0.886, "box": [[354, 541], [502, 544], [501, 575], [354, 572]]}, {"text": "Ensuringthe", "conf": 0.892, "box": [[735, 543], [881, 539], [882, 568], [736, 572]]}, {"text": "accesstoright", "conf": 0.901, "box": [[349, 577], [511, 577], [511, 604], [349, 604]]}, {"text": "information", "conf": 0.903, "box": [[739, 572], [878, 572], [878, 602], [739, 602]]}, {"text": "information", "conf": 0.871, "box": [[360, 606], [502, 606], [502, 636], [360, 636]]}, {"text": "integrity", "conf": 0.893, "box": [[756, 606], [859, 606], [859, 633], [756, 633]]}, {"text": "ICTETHICS", "conf": 0.809, "box": [[546, 719], [744, 719], [744, 749], [546, 749]]}, {"text": "Enforcingthe", "conf": 0.86, "box": [[331, 833], [484, 837], [483, 865], [331, 861]]}, {"text": "Enforcing the", "conf": 0.89, "box": [[762, 832], [913, 832], [913, 862], [762, 862]]}, {"text": "copy/propertyrights", "conf": 0.938, "box": [[287, 866], [525, 868], [524, 895], [287, 893]]}, {"text": "rightto", "conf": 0.8, "box": [[794, 865], [882, 865], [882, 893], [794, 893]]}, {"text": "ofinformation", "conf": 0.924, "box": [[325, 897], [490, 897], [490, 924], [325, 924]]}, {"text": "Privacy", "conf": 0.862, "box": [[793, 892], [884, 898], [882, 926], [791, 920]]}, {"text": "ICT Ethics", "conf": 0.819, "box": [[547, 976], [672, 979], [671, 1010], [546, 1007]]}, {"text": "Ethics means a set of moral principles that govern the behavior of an individual or a", "conf": 0.915, "box": [[37, 1087], [1166, 1093], [1165, 1130], [37, 1124]]}, {"text": "group.", "conf": 0.851, "box": [[36, 1146], [121, 1146], [121, 1181], [36, 1181]]}, {"text": "IcT Ethics deals with the procedures, values and practices that govern the process of", "conf": 0.927, "box": [[35, 1197], [1171, 1203], [1171, 1238], [35, 1233]]}, {"text": "using ICT and its related disciplines without damaging or violating the moral values.", "conf": 0.939, "box": [[37, 1251], [1176, 1254], [1176, 1290], [37, 1287]]}, {"text": "The objectives of IcT ethics are to ensure the privacy and safety of the computer users", "conf": 0.919, "box": [[39, 1317], [1170, 1321], [1170, 1354], [39, 1350]]}, {"text": "and help the peopleto usethe computerin a right way.", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[39, 1365], [739, 1368], [739, 1405], [39, 1402]]}, {"text": "5.1.1DigitalPlagiarism", "conf": 0.92, "box": [[37, 1418], [439, 1424], [439, 1463], [37, 1458]]}, {"text": "Plagiarism is the act of copying and presenting someone else's work like text (essay,", "conf": 0.944, "box": [[37, 1480], [1172, 1486], [1171, 1525], [37, 1519]]}, {"text": "paragraph etc.), media (picture, music, videos etc.) and even ideas or software as your", "conf": 0.935, "box": [[39, 1536], [1172, 1540], [1172, 1573], [39, 1569]]}, {"text": "own.", "conf": 0.789, "box": [[38, 1587], [101, 1592], [99, 1621], [36, 1616]]}, {"text": "75", "conf": 0.606, "box": [[569, 1657], [605, 1657], [605, 1687], [569, 1687]]}, {"text": "Unit 5:Digital Citizenship", "conf": 0.908, "box": [[728, 1659], [956, 1661], [956, 1687], [728, 1685]]}]}